{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "613edbfd-9d2a-80b7-889b-edc1623a755d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T15:20:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I'm calling about trash. Somebody keeps dumping bags at the corner near my house, and I want to know how to request a replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:16:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A replacement for what, sir? A trash barrel, or a bin that got damaged or taken?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:16:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My barrel. It's gone. After the storm that ended Monday, the snow turning to rain, I came out Tuesday and it wasn't at the curb. I think it got knocked into the road and picked up, or somebody took it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So your barrel is missing since the storm, and separately there are bags being left at the corner. Let me get the address first. Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "139 Bliss Road. Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "139 Bliss Road. Got it. And the bags, are those at the corner of Bliss Road, or a cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner right by my house. A neighbor leaves them there. I've seen him do it a couple of times. Black bags, mostly, stacked against the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:17:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm writing that down. Black bags, stacked by the pole at the corner, near 139. Do you know when they usually show up? Before pickup day, after?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the night before or early morning. I'm a pastry chef, I start at four in the morning, so I leave the house in the dark. That's when I see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so early morning, around four or a little before. That helps. Is it the same spot every time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same spot. Same pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And did the bags get picked up this week, or are they still sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still there as of this morning. Four bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four bags, still there Thursday morning. I'll put that in as a report so it can be looked at. I can't say what happens with the neighbor, that would be up to whoever follows up, but it'll be on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just want them gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Now, for the replacement barrel. I'll put in a request for a new one to 139 Bliss Road. Was it the city-issued barrel, the kind with the lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Green, with the lid. City one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Green with a lid, city-issued. And you said it went missing sometime between the storm and Tuesday morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I put it out Sunday night before the snow. Monday it was probably still there. Tuesday, gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so last seen Sunday night or Monday. Let me read it back. Missing green city barrel at 139 Bliss Road, last seen around the storm, replacement requested. And separate report of bags dumped at the corner by the pole. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Can I get a callback number in case the office needs to confirm something about the delivery?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tony Barone. B-A-R-O-N-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Barone. Barone, B-A-R-O-N-E. The new barrel usually gets dropped at the property, so you shouldn't need to go anywhere. It may take a few days to a week or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week is okay. What do I do with my trash until then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For now, you can put it out in sturdy bags at the curb on your pickup day. Just keep them closed and away from the snowbanks so they're easy to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Barone. Have a good rest of your afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
